## 📏 New Mobile Button Sizes

### Tablet (768px and below)
```css
padding: 10px 18px;    /* was 12px 24px */
font-size: 0.9em;      /* was 1em */
min-height: 42px;      /* was 48px */
gap: 7px;              /* was 10px */
```

### Phone (480px and below)
```css
padding: 9px 16px;     /* was 12px 24px */
font-size: 0.85em;     /* was 1em */
min-height: 40px;      /* was 48px */
gap: 6px;              /* was 10px */
```

---

## 🎯 Benefits

| Metric | Before | After | Improvement |
|--------|--------|-------|-------------|
| Button Height | 48px | 40-42px | ↓ 12-17% |
| Horizontal Padding | 24px | 16-18px | ↓ 25-33% |
| Font Size | 1em | 0.85-0.9em | ↓ 10-15% |
| Screen Space Used | ~55% | ~40% | ↓ 15% more content visible |

