## 🔧 Quick Test

To see the changes:
1. Open any page in Chrome DevTools (F12)
2. Toggle device toolbar (Ctrl+Shift+M)
3. Select "iPhone SE" or "Galaxy S20"
4. Compare button sizes before/after

